Architecture diagram skill

Install:
  Prepare Node/pnpm and Git when missing; copy the named skill using skills CLI. Verify the Node-based skill CLI with doctor; no npm install inside the skill is needed.

Upgrade:
  Refresh only this skill and run the same runtime preparation steps.

Status:
  Report local skill files and Node version; run the installed CLI doctor offline.

Requirements:
  Ubuntu, APT and a regular user with sudo access.

Configuration:
  Source: https://github.com/tt-a1i/archify
  Destination: ~/.agents/skills/archify
  An existing Codex copy at $CODEX_HOME/skills/archify becomes a link to this directory.
  CODEX_HOME defaults to ~/.codex.
  First skill backup: ~/.local/state/wsley/skills-backups/.
  Codex authentication is configured separately.
